{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Aura-Luna 是一款專為提升情緒健康而設計的私密 AI 伴侶應用，適合尋求傾聽對象或希望記錄日常心情的用戶。這款 App 提供真誠對話、情緒追蹤及反思日記功能，現正限時免費下載，讓你隨時擁有一位懂你的智能夥伴。</p>\n\n<h2>多元角色與記憶功能</h2>\n<p>用戶可從 Aura、Sage、Luna 及 Nova 四位具備不同性格的 AI 伴侶中選擇，透過語音或文字進行自然交流。這些伴侶能記住用戶的重要偏好與經歷，確保對話個人化且不重複。此外，App 內建每日心情檢查、私密日記及可完全掌控的記憶庫，協助用戶洞察情緒模式並促進自我理解。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1278-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1279-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1280-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1281-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1282-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-669-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Aura-Luna</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-29T02:18:53.644755+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":303,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}